WEBVTT

00:00:10.462 --> 00:00:11.622
(DORY SCREAMS)

00:00:11.782 --> 00:00:13.302
-Dory!
-Come on.

00:00:14.822 --> 00:00:16.982
Help! Get us out!

00:00:17.742 --> 00:00:20.102
No, no, no! Dory!

00:00:20.182 --> 00:00:22.382
-Dad, I know what to do.
-Nemo, no!

00:00:22.462 --> 00:00:25.182
We have to tell all the fish
to swim down together.

00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:27.542
-Get out of there.
-This will work.

00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:29.942
No, I am not going to lose you again.

00:00:30.022 --> 00:00:33.342
There's no time.
It's the only way we can save Dory.

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:36.142
I can do this!

00:00:37.902 --> 00:00:41.262
You're right. I know you can.

00:00:41.702 --> 00:00:44.742
-NEMO: Lucky fin.
-Now, go. Hurry!

00:00:44.822 --> 00:00:47.062
Tell all the fish to swim down.

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:50.502
Well, you heard my son. Come on.

00:00:52.262 --> 00:00:56.582
-Dory, you have to tell everybody to...
-Swim down together.

00:00:56.662 --> 00:00:58.822
Do you understand what I'm saying?

00:00:58.902 --> 00:01:00.702
Swim down!

00:01:05.182 --> 00:01:08.862
-Everybody swim down.
-Come on. You have to swim down.

00:01:08.982 --> 00:01:11.662
Down! Swim down!

00:01:13.902 --> 00:01:17.382
Swim down! Swim down!

00:01:25.302 --> 00:01:27.582
Don't give up! Keep swimming!

00:01:28.662 --> 00:01:30.542
Just keep swimming!

00:01:34.822 --> 00:01:35.862
MARLIN: That's it!

00:01:39.422 --> 00:01:40.742
It's working!

00:01:43.582 --> 00:01:46.702
ALL: Keep swimming!

00:01:46.782 --> 00:01:49.342
Just keep swimming!

00:01:49.422 --> 00:01:51.662
-Come on, Dad!
-You're doing great, son.

00:01:51.742 --> 00:01:54.102
-That's my dad.
-Let's get to the bottom.

00:01:55.222 --> 00:01:57.342
♪ Just keep swimming ♪

00:01:57.422 --> 00:01:59.582
MARLIN: Almost there. Keep swimming!

00:02:03.182 --> 00:02:04.422
ALL: Keep swimming!

00:02:06.902 --> 00:02:07.942
ALL: Keep swimming!

00:02:15.102 --> 00:02:17.102
(CHEERING)

00:02:19.422 --> 00:02:20.502
Hey!

00:02:20.582 --> 00:02:22.022
Where's Nemo?

00:02:22.462 --> 00:02:23.502
There!

00:02:26.182 --> 00:02:28.022
Oh, no. Nemo!

00:02:35.062 --> 00:02:36.262
Nemo?

00:02:37.982 --> 00:02:38.982
Nemo?

00:02:40.742 --> 00:02:43.782
It's okay. Daddy's here.
Daddy's got you.

00:02:49.022 --> 00:02:51.382
-Daddy?
-Oh, thank goodness.

00:02:51.462 --> 00:02:53.222
Daddy...

00:02:53.302 --> 00:02:56.062
-I don't hate you.
-Oh, no, no, no.

00:02:57.182 --> 00:02:59.582
I'm so sorry, Nemo.

00:03:09.182 --> 00:03:11.342
Hey, guess what?

00:03:11.422 --> 00:03:13.782
-What?
-Sea turtles...

00:03:13.862 --> 00:03:15.742
I met one.

00:03:15.822 --> 00:03:19.622
And he was 150 years old.

00:03:19.702 --> 00:03:21.662
150?

00:03:21.782 --> 00:03:23.262
Yep.

00:03:23.982 --> 00:03:28.022
'Cause Sandy Plankton said
they only lived to be 100.

00:03:29.022 --> 00:03:30.422
Sandy Plankton?

00:03:30.502 --> 00:03:34.342
Think I would cross the ocean and
not know as much as Sandy Plankton?

00:03:34.422 --> 00:03:37.182
He was 150! Not 100.

00:03:37.262 --> 00:03:40.662
Who is this Sandy Plankton
that knows everything wrong?

00:03:42.942 --> 00:03:46.342
Time for school! Time for school!
Get up! Let's go!

00:03:47.262 --> 00:03:50.142
-I'm going to win.
-No, you're not.

00:03:50.222 --> 00:03:53.702
-I did it.
-My own son beats me.

00:03:53.782 --> 00:03:55.822
Climb aboard, explorers.

00:03:55.942 --> 00:03:59.262
So then the sea cucumber looks over
at the mollusk and says,

00:03:59.342 --> 00:04:01.782
"With fronds like these,
who needs anemones?"

00:04:04.062 --> 00:04:05.862
Well, hello, Nemo. Who's this?

00:04:05.942 --> 00:04:09.302
-Exchange student.
-I'm from the EAC, dude.

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:11.702
-Sweet.
-Totally.

00:04:12.582 --> 00:04:16.302
Seriously, Marty, did you really do
all the things you say you did?

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:17.662
BRUCE: Pardon me.

00:04:18.582 --> 00:04:19.622
Hello.

00:04:21.142 --> 00:04:22.702
Don't be alarmed.

00:04:22.782 --> 00:04:25.942
We wanted to make sure
our newest member got home safely.

00:04:26.022 --> 00:04:28.102
-Thanks.
-We'll see you next week.

00:04:28.182 --> 00:04:31.702
-Keep up with the program, Dory.
-Remember, fish are friends.

00:04:31.782 --> 00:04:34.182
Not food! Bye!

00:04:34.262 --> 00:04:36.142
Hold on. Here we go.

00:04:36.222 --> 00:04:37.862
Next stop, knowledge.

00:04:37.942 --> 00:04:40.422
Bye, son. Have fun.

00:04:40.502 --> 00:04:41.622
NEMO: Bye, Dad.

00:04:42.702 --> 00:04:45.062
Oh! Mr. Ray, wait. I forgot something.

00:04:50.182 --> 00:04:51.862
Love you, Dad.

00:04:53.102 --> 00:04:55.102
I love you, too, son.

00:04:57.902 --> 00:05:00.262
Uh, Dad? You can let go now.

00:05:00.342 --> 00:05:01.702
Sorry.

00:05:01.782 --> 00:05:03.902
Now go have an adventure.

00:05:03.982 --> 00:05:06.262
Goodbye. See you later, dudes!

00:05:06.382 --> 00:05:08.102
-Bye, Elmo.
-Nemo.

00:05:08.182 --> 00:05:11.702
-Nemo. Bye, Nemo.
-See you after school, Dory.

00:05:12.622 --> 00:05:13.902
NEMO: Bye, Dad!

00:05:15.422 --> 00:05:16.902
Bye, son.

00:05:34.822 --> 00:05:36.022
SHERMAN: Barbara.
BARBARA: Mmm-hmm?

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:37.582
I don't understand it.

00:05:37.662 --> 00:05:40.902
Here this thing has a lifetime guarantee
and it breaks.

00:05:40.982 --> 00:05:45.622
Had to clean the tank myself,
take the fish out, put 'em in bags and...

00:05:46.062 --> 00:05:47.942
Where'd the fish go?

00:05:49.742 --> 00:05:50.982
(CAR HORNS)

00:05:53.382 --> 00:05:55.702
Come on, Peach!

00:05:55.782 --> 00:05:58.262
You got it. That's it. You can do it.

00:05:58.342 --> 00:06:00.582
That's the shortest red light
I've ever seen.

00:06:00.662 --> 00:06:02.382
Come on, Peach.

00:06:02.982 --> 00:06:04.502
(CHEERING)

00:06:05.982 --> 00:06:08.022
(TRIUMPHANT LAUGHTER)

00:06:12.262 --> 00:06:13.542
Now what?

00:06:15.982 --> 00:06:18.302
(POP MUSIC PLAYING)

